        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 61.7" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="581" ed="#liebermann"/>De omnibus et quibuscunque sciendum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="32" target="#Hn_61-7.lnote.oe.32"/>, quod cause, quas<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="p" target="#Hn_61-7.lnote.oe.p"/> prediximus<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="33" target="#Hn_61-7.lnote.oe.33"/>, ad excusacionem sufficiunt et quaslibet<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="34" target="#Hn_61-7.lnote.oe.34"/> inpugnacionum decertationes<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="35" target="#Hn_61-7.lnote.oe.35"/> euertunt: hoc est<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="27" target="#Hn_61-7.lnote.oe.27"/> uel infirmitatis uel domini neccessitatis uel contramandacionis uel regis implacitacionis uel inoperacionis causa.</ab>
